  <item>
    <title>逃生爬梯004-得了癌症总得有点儿好处吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6431115fa79cc81470f01336</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6431115fa79cc81470f01336</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Apr 2023 07:01:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好啊，这期节目我承认我在拖。录的时候心情很好，录完却不敢剪，怕听、怕回忆。说一千道一万，这些日子真的很苦了，我不是心态好，而是如果不苦中作乐，真的撑不下去。谢谢每一个听节目的你，我的对象真的很好，希望他这辈子比我幸福很多很多。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 一段近期情况的汇报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 和我妈成为病友啦哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 上次在广州崩溃的心情，或许每个人都需要精神支柱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 是什么让我在街边痛哭（幸好提前买了纸巾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 心态就是不停地打破和重建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 林奇综合症一线治疗方法-免疫治疗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 我曾经也在很努力地生活啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> 退休的妈妈在坚持做妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 不得病不敢说，终于出柜了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> 说到好处，这就来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 侄子确诊儿童朗格汉斯细胞组织增生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 肠癌的分期、衡量维度（T、N、M）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 最近开心的事情：怎么在晒对象？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llu-Bsu3cNKppUUVfHikuQZO91ry.m4a" length="37311033" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqSHJsNTdDVDFpUFlLVzdobll6ZTFod202ME8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>逃生爬梯003-癌了后要做什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64187b8273768bea35f51854</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64187b8273768bea35f51854</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Mar 2023 15:28:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好这里是纽扣～这期节目录地有点丧，但是里面的关于确诊癌症后的检查科普还是值得一听啦！希望你健康、快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 关于医院的纪录片-《人间世》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 癌了后我想从医生处获得什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 影像学的检查（CT和MR）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> PET MR是有辐射的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> CA199</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 外科医生的指诊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 一些近况，没啥副作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 以后真的好远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 在持续性地怕死和坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 还是要喝好喝的咖啡啊</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmIA4Lkgp6iW8QdfbYtNS5Tbz87P.m4a" length="35793321" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqSHJsNTdDVDFpUFlLVzdobll6ZTFod202ME8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>逃生爬梯002-医生别切我啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64049ddbc5d7e6e06046376d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64049ddbc5d7e6e06046376d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Mar 2023 13:49:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello这里是纽扣！本期会跟大家分享我是如何以及为何从深圳逃往广州求医的。同样也非常适合刚刚确诊肠癌的朋友听，记得做肠胃镜啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 最近有成就感的一件小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 关于肠癌的简单科普、肠镜的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 不要谈癌色变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 我是怎么确诊肠癌的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 深圳最让我想逃离的医院和医生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 关于医生让我去小红书看病的这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 说去就去的广州，我很庆幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 未知和无知的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 每天吃五顿和喝咖啡的乐趣，我爱广州</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqMTDfFigcegzEFUZakpnKj0DgE-.m4a" length="30952889" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqSHJsNTdDVDFpUFlLVzdobll6ZTFod202ME8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>逃生爬梯001-31岁确诊癌症，一场几乎注定的意外。</title>
