    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 10:10:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，很高兴重启播客。虽然动机和时间来源显得有点悲哀，但我想，这是我扭转人生的好机会！我是纽扣，很高兴你听到我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 做播客的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 纽扣是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 我是怎么发现癌了的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 林奇综合症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 现在的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 逃生爬梯名字的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 第一期的迷茫碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎随时找我 @纽扣扣上扣子</span></p>]]></description>
